# never any key material in this repo — the signing key home lives outside
# the tree (~/.spectroscope-apt-key)
*.sec
*secret*
*PRIVATE*
.DS_Store

# The pool cannot live in git: GitHub refuses any file over 100 MB (GH001,
# measured on the 178 MB deb), and Pages does not resolve LFS pointers either.
# The indexes, the key and the scripts are small and belong here; the packages
# they describe need object storage or the release assets. See README.
pool/
